Pre-generated ElevenLabs MP3s land here, one per StringKey, written by
`scripts/generate-phrases.ts`. The MP3 files are committed to the repo —
this `.gitkeep` exists so the empty directory is checked in before the
first run.

To populate (requires ELEVENLABS_API_KEY + ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID):

    npm run generate:phrases

To regenerate every phrase even if the file already exists:

    npm run generate:phrases -- --force

To regenerate one specific key:

    npm run generate:phrases -- --key RECORDING_POSTED
